WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Signing in and out. One Noirly account for Flow and every other Noirly app, through a secure popup.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: joining from an invite; shared computer.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose Noirly Login → Sign in with Noirly Identity → Your Personal workspace is ready

4
00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.150
(Note: The Noirly Identity popup isn't recorded: the isolated test server signs in with a test session instead of a live account.) Signed in, Flow opens your Personal workspace — created for you on your first visit.

5
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.890
Sign out sits at the bottom of the main sidebar.

6
00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:24.830
You're back on the sign-in page. Noirly Login opens Identity in a secure popup.

7
00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:30.830
The popup doesn't open: Allow popups for Flow's address in your browser, then choose Noirly Login again. I'm sent to /login from an invite link: That's expected when you're signed out; after signing in you return to the invite.

8
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.330
Sign in with Noirly Identity in a secure popup
